    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello大家好，我是阿泰，这是一档畅聊字圈生活的播客，第一期节目主要是向大家科普我们的职业——手写师，它因为过于小众而罕为人知，我们希望与你分享作为从业者的真实感受，也从内部人员的角度给一些手写定制的小建议，你会听到：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>穿梭在CBD的穷苦打工日常</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>全能的职业写字人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>那些下班时间的快乐面基</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>那些疯狂赶稿的心酸故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>给到入行新人的一些建议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于定制礼品的意义和小tips</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=0s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=0s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></a><span>开场；嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=91s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=91s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a></span></a><span>一些活动故事</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=408s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=408s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a></span></a><span> 都市丽人的穷苦打工日常</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=603s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=603s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a></span></a><span>下班时间的快乐面基</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=696s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=696s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a></span></a><span> 一些有趣好看的手写品</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=1063s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HUhJF3suk2I&amp;t=1063s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">17:43</a></span></a><span>全能的职业写字人</span></p><span></span><p><a href=